ation touchups and minor skill arrangements. A dip into the Salt Estuary, a place you won't go to in the demo because Glist says no.A comfy river den to the west, which can't go anywhere because it is a demo.Combat pace increased, a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T01:00:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067927949","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3065270-1836506165570931","game_id":"steam-3065270","kind":"announcement","title":"Crop and Claw 2 Demo is up!","summary":"After a year and a half, Crop and Claw 2 has a public demo. The scope carries about an hour of playtime, or a little longer if replayed with different builds or challenge runs.There's quirks remaining in it, but the crux is there. It is the first act, and gives a small taste of the future of dragon gaming. Crop and Claw 2 is also compatible for Android and ARM Linux handhelds, available on itch as of writing.Bug fixes and updates will be slow, as focus will be moving to the main game, but Crop a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-03T16:00:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165570931","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3065270":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:43Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:42Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3065270":"2026-10-26T10:15:43Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3065270":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:42Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:42Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:42Z"},"4824960":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:43Z","last_success_at":"